                       "type":  "text",
                       "options":  {
                                       "mode":  "markdown",
                                       "content":  "### Ver o trace completo de um pedido\n\n1. Gere pedidos: `./scripts/demo_flow.sh` ou `./scripts/load_orders.sh 10`\n2. Clique nos links abaixo (Explore → Tempo) e então na **Trace ID** para abrir a visão **waterfall** completa\n   - [Traces do POST /orders (order-service)](http://localhost:3000/explore?schemaVersion=1\u0026panes=%7B%22dy3%22%3A%20%7B%22datasource%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22queries%22%3A%20%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%20%22A%22%2C%20%22queryType%22%3A%20%22traceql%22%2C%20%22query%22%3A%20%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D%20%5C%22order-service%5C%22%20%26%26%20name%20%3D%20%5C%22POST%20/orders%5C%22%20%7D%22%2C%20%22datasource%22%3A%20%7B%22type%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22uid%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%20%22range%22%3A%20%7B%22from%22%3A%20%22now-60m%22%2C%20%22to%22%3A%20%22now%22%7D%7D%7D\u0026orgId=1)\n   - [Spans server de todos os serviços (fluxo completo)](http://localhost:3000/explore?schemaVersion=1\u0026panes=%7B%22dy3%22%3A%20%7B%22datasource%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22queries%22%3A%20%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%20%22A%22%2C%20%22queryType%22%3A%20%22traceql%22%2C%20%22query%22%3A%20%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22catalog-service%7Ccart-service%7Corder-service%7Cpayment-service%5C%22%20%26%26%20kind%20%3D%20server%20%7D%22%2C%20%22datasource%22%3A%20%7B%22type%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22uid%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%20%22range%22%3A%20%7B%22from%22%3A%20%22now-60m%22%2C%20%22to%22%3A%20%22now%22%7D%7D%7D\u0026orgId=1)\n   - [Todos os traces recentes](http://localhost:3000/explore?schemaVersion=1\u0026panes=%7B%22dy3%22%3A%20%7B%22datasource%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22queries%22%3A%20%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%20%22A%22%2C%20%22queryType%22%3A%20%22traceql%22%2C%20%22query%22%3A%20%22%7B%7D%22%2C%20%22datasource%22%3A%20%7B%22type%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%2C%20%22uid%22%3A%20%22tempo%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%20%22range%22%3A%20%7B%22from%22%3A%20%22now-30m%22%2C%20%22to%22%3A%20%22now%22%7D%7D%7D\u0026orgId=1)\n\n**Log → Trace:** no Explore do Loki, expanda uma linha de log e clique em **\"Debug: View Technical Trace\"** (campo derivado `traceId`).\n\n**Span → Logs:** no waterfall do Tempo, o painel **\"Related logs\"** busca no Loki linhas com o mesmo `traceId`.\n\n\u003e O trace de um pedido conecta: `order → cart` (lê carrinho) → `catalog` (reserva estoque) → `payment` (pagamento) no mesmo traceId, via W3C Trace Context + X-Correlation-ID propagados pelo gateway."
                                   },
